@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## 5.0.0-m2.7-hf4 - Process Safety & System Tray Hotfix
+
+### What changed
+- EMP can no longer close while a movie is actively being processed.
+- Closing during active processing offers Finish current movie, then exit; Keep processing; or Minimize to hidden icons.
+- A system-tray icon provides Restore EMP and Exit EMP controls.
+- If exit is requested during a movie, EMP waits for that movie to finish safely before closing.
+
+### Why this helps
+An accidental window close can no longer interrupt an active encode/copy/verify workflow. Users can safely leave EMP running in the Windows notification area's hidden icons while the current movie continues.
+
